<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/4/msa@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 7 seksyen yang berikut: Jurisdiction 7A. Notwithstanding the provisions of any written law of a to the contrary, a First Class Magistrate shall have the court of the First jurisdiction to try any offence under this Act or any Class regulations made under this Act, and to impose the full Magistrate. punishment for any such offence.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/4/msa@> .
